'''Sulfur bricks''' are a decorative [[brick]] variant of [[sulfur]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sulfur bricks drop as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Sulfur Bricks|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

